        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkum tang the ting kum kathan thao dat the,",
            "Asei tingkum tingmik than pat the;",
            "Zip bam khou rui zipthau o, lung neihlana,",
            "Neihla na thuan kho tingmik than pat mei ta.",
            "",
            "Guang o guang o Poubaomei thuan ku khang ,",
            "Kazauzian ta mu ni mei thou cho?",
            "Tingkum khum na gaina gaeklou mei Pu e,",
            "Tingsaeng zaeng na kazan kahim dai kandiu.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkwm tang na tatmei zianmei nun ram ma,",
            "Aniu rui taanpui bam kathui khou;",
            "Swnu-naunian theipui bam khou rui kanlou,",
            "Neihlaa na taanlou mei guay thei lai kandiu.",
            "",
            "3. Neihlaa mei gaipui lat tei phung na guang o.",
            "Poubaomei guang the suaihiam lou khang,",
            "Poubaomei rui nang ta neilaa lou puni,",
            "Silou mei guay tei ndao na lung lai o",
            "",
            "4. Theikum ta ganlou na tingkum than thuan o,",
            "Nang kai kapum na guang na thuan o;",
            "Theithu Poubaomei suaihiam mei lapuni,",
            "Neihlaa na thuanc kho Poubaumei kanloumei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
